## 2. Mobile‑broken Save button (R2)

The button was rendered outside the same flex container, causing it to wrap and be hidden on small screens. I moved it into the flex column and added a media query:

```css
/* src/styles/settings.css */
.settings-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.save-btn {
  align-self: flex-end;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .save-btn {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
}
```

This keeps the button visible and tappable on mobile devices.

